---@field city? string City or ward.
---@field country? string Two-letter country code ([ISO 3166-1 alpha-2](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_3166-1_alpha-2)).
---@field line1? string Block or building number.
---@field line2? string Building details.
---@field postal_code? string Postal code.
---@field state? string Prefecture.
---@field town? string Town or cho-me.

---The location where the business is administered.
