---@field payer? stripe.CreateAccountRequestControllerFeesPayer|string Controls who pays Stripe fees for direct charges and other pricing-control-eligible Stripe products. Setting `controller.losses.payments=application` requires `controller.fees.payer=application`. For destination charges and separate charges and transfers, Stripe bills the platform regardless of this setting. Defaults to `account`. Learn more about [fee behavior on connected accounts](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/direct-charges-fee-payer-behavior), including application fees and pricing considerations.

