---Settings that apply across payment methods for charging on the account.
---@class stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayments
---@field statement_descriptor? string The default text that appears on statements for non-card charges outside of Japan. For card charges, if you don't set a `statement_descriptor_prefix`, this text is also used as the statement descriptor prefix. In that case, if concatenating the statement descriptor suffix causes the combined statement descriptor to exceed 22 characters, we truncate the `statement_descriptor` text to limit the full descriptor to 22 characters. For more information about statement descriptors and their requirements, see the [account settings documentation](https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/account/statement-descriptors).
---@field statement_descriptor_kana? string The Kana variation of `statement_descriptor` used for charges in Japan. Japanese statement descriptors have [special requirements](https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/account/statement-descriptors#set-japanese-statement-descriptors).
---@field statement_descriptor_kanji? string The Kanji variation of `statement_descriptor` used for charges in Japan. Japanese statement descriptors have [special requirements](https://docs.stripe.com/get-started/account/statement-descriptors#set-japanese-statement-descriptors).

---Settings specific to the account's payouts.
---@class stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayouts
---@field debit_negative_balances? boolean A Boolean indicating whether Stripe should try to reclaim negative balances from an attached bank account. For details, see [Understanding Connect Account Balances](/connect/account-balances).
---@field schedule? stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsSchedule Details on when funds from charges are available, and when they are paid out to an external account. For details, see our [Setting Bank and Debit Card Payouts](/connect/bank-transfers#payout-information) documentation.
---@field statement_descriptor? string The text that appears on the bank account statement for payouts. If not set, this defaults to the platform's bank descriptor as set in the Dashboard.

---Details on when funds from charges are available, and when they are paid out to an external account. For details, see our [Setting Bank and Debit Card Payouts](/connect/bank-transfers#payout-information) documentation.
---@class stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsSchedule
---@field delay_days? stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleDelayDays The number of days charge funds are held before being paid out. May also be set to `minimum`, representing the lowest available value for the account country. Default is `minimum`. The `delay_days` parameter remains at the last configured value if `interval` is `manual`. [Learn more about controlling payout delay days](/connect/manage-payout-schedule).
---@field interval? stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleInterval|string How frequently available funds are paid out. One of: `daily`, `manual`, `weekly`, or `monthly`. Default is `daily`.
---@field monthly_anchor? number The day of the month when available funds are paid out, specified as a number between 1--31. Payouts nominally scheduled between the 29th and 31st of the month are instead sent on the last day of a shorter month. Required and applicable only if `interval` is `monthly`.
---@field monthly_payout_days? stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleMonthlyPayoutDaysList The days of the month when available funds are paid out, specified as an array of numbers between 1--31. Payouts nominally scheduled between the 29th and 31st of the month are instead sent on the last day of a shorter month. Required and applicable only if `interval` is `monthly` and `monthly_anchor` is not set.
---@field weekly_anchor? stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleWeeklyAnchor|string The day of the week when available funds are paid out, specified as `monday`, `tuesday`, etc. Required and applicable only if `interval` is `weekly`.
---@field weekly_payout_days? stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleWeeklyPayoutDaysList The days of the week when available funds are paid out, specified as an array, e.g., [`monday`, `tuesday`]. Required and applicable only if `interval` is `weekly`.

---The number of days charge funds are held before being paid out. May also be set to `minimum`, representing the lowest available value for the account country. Default is `minimum`. The `delay_days` parameter remains at the last configured value if `interval` is `manual`. [Learn more about controlling payout delay days](/connect/manage-payout-schedule).
---@alias stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleDelayDays stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleDelayDaysCase0|string|number

---@alias stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleDelayDaysCase0 "minimum"

---How frequently available funds are paid out. One of: `daily`, `manual`, `weekly`, or `monthly`. Default is `daily`.
---@alias stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleInterval "daily"|"manual"|"monthly"|"weekly"

---The days of the month when available funds are paid out, specified as an array of numbers between 1--31. Payouts nominally scheduled between the 29th and 31st of the month are instead sent on the last day of a shorter month. Required and applicable only if `interval` is `monthly` and `monthly_anchor` is not set.
---@alias stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleMonthlyPayoutDaysList number[]

---The day of the week when available funds are paid out, specified as `monday`, `tuesday`, etc. Required and applicable only if `interval` is `weekly`.
---@alias stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleWeeklyAnchor "friday"|"monday"|"saturday"|"sunday"|"thursday"|"tuesday"|"wednesday"

---@alias stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleWeeklyPayoutDaysItem "friday"|"monday"|"thursday"|"tuesday"|"wednesday"

---The days of the week when available funds are paid out, specified as an array, e.g., [`monday`, `tuesday`]. Required and applicable only if `interval` is `weekly`.
---@alias stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleWeeklyPayoutDaysList (stripe.CreateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleWeeklyPayoutDaysItem|string)[]

