---@class stripe.CreateCoreAccountLinkRequestUseCaseAccountOnboarding
---@field collection_options? stripe.CreateCoreAccountLinkRequestUseCaseAccountOnboardingCollectionOptions Specifies the requirements that Stripe collects from v2/core/accounts in the Onboarding flow.
---@field refresh_url string The URL the user will be redirected to if the AccountLink is expired, has been used, or is otherwise invalid. The URL you specify should attempt to generate a new AccountLink with the same parameters used to create the original AccountLink, then redirect the user to the new AccountLink’s URL so they can continue the flow. If a new AccountLink cannot be generated or the redirect fails you should display a useful error to the user. Please make sure to implement authentication before redirecting the user in case this URL is leaked to a third party.
---@field return_url? string The URL that the user will be redirected to upon completing the linked flow.

