---@field individual_name? stripe.CreateCustomerRequestIndividualName The customer's full name. This may be up to *150 characters*.
---@field invoice_prefix? string The prefix for the customer used to generate unique invoice numbers. Must be 1–12 uppercase letters or numbers.
