---@field recurring stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsItemsItemPriceDataRecurring The recurring components of a price such as `interval` and `interval_count`.
---@field tax_behavior? stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsItemsItemPriceDataTaxBehavior|string Only required if a [default tax behavior](https://docs.stripe.com/tax/products-prices-tax-categories-tax-behavior#setting-a-default-tax-behavior-(recommended)) was not provided in the Stripe Tax settings. Specifies whether the price is considered inclusive of taxes or exclusive of taxes. One of `inclusive`, `exclusive`, or `unspecified`. Once specified as either `inclusive` or `exclusive`, it cannot be changed.
---@field unit_amount? number A positive integer in cents (or local equivalent) (or 0 for a free price) representing how much to charge.
---@field unit_amount_decimal? string Same as `unit_amount`, but accepts a decimal value in cents (or local equivalent) with at most 12 decimal places. Only one of `unit_amount` and `unit_amount_decimal` can be set.

---The recurring components of a price such as `interval` and `interval_count`.
---@class stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsItemsItemPriceDataRecurring
---@field interval stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsItemsItemPriceDataRecurringInterval|string Specifies billing frequency. Either `day`, `week`, `month` or `year`.
---@field interval_count? number The number of intervals between subscription billings. For example, `interval=month` and `interval_count=3` bills every 3 months. Maximum of three years interval allowed (3 years, 36 months, or 156 weeks).

---Specifies billing frequency. Either `day`, `week`, `month` or `year`.
