---@field bill_for? stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsPauseBillFor Controls what to bill for when pausing the subscription.
---@field invoicing_behavior? stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsPauseInvoicingBehavior|string Determines how to handle debits and credits when pausing. Defaults to `pending_invoice_item`.
---@field type? stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsPauseType|string The type of pause to apply. Defaults to `subscription`.

---Controls what to bill for when pausing the subscription.
