---@field outstanding_usage_through? stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsPauseBillForOutstandingUsageThrough Controls when to bill for metered usage in the current period. Defaults to `{ type: "now" }`.
---@field unused_time_from? stripe.CreateInvoicesCreatePreviewRequestSubscriptionDetailsPauseBillForUnusedTimeFrom Controls when to credit for unused time on licensed items. Defaults to `{ type: "now" }`.

