---@class stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControls
---@field allowed_card_presences? stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCardPresencesList Array of card presence statuses from which authorizations will be allowed. Possible options are `present`, `not_present`. All other statuses will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_card_presences`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field allowed_categories? stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCategoriesList Array of strings containing [categories](https://docs.stripe.com/api#issuing_authorization_object-merchant_data-category) of authorizations to allow. All other categories will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_categories`.
---@field allowed_merchant_countries? stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControlsAllowedMerchantCountriesList Array of strings containing representing countries from which authorizations will be allowed. Authorizations from merchants in all other countries will be declined. Country codes should be ISO 3166 alpha-2 country codes (e.g. `US`). Cannot be set with `blocked_merchant_countries`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field blocked_card_presences? stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControlsBlockedCardPresencesList Array of card presence statuses from which authorizations will be declined. Possible options are `present`, `not_present`. Cannot be set with `allowed_card_presences`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field blocked_categories? stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControlsBlockedCategoriesList Array of strings containing [categories](https://docs.stripe.com/api#issuing_authorization_object-merchant_data-category) of authorizations to decline. All other categories will be allowed. Cannot be set with `allowed_categories`.
---@field blocked_merchant_countries? stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControlsBlockedMerchantCountriesList Array of strings containing representing countries from which authorizations will be declined. Country codes should be ISO 3166 alpha-2 country codes (e.g. `US`). Cannot be set with `allowed_merchant_countries`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field spending_limits? stripe.CreateIssuingCardRequestSpendingControlsSpendingLimitsList Limit spending with amount-based rules that apply across any cards this card replaced (i.e., its `replacement_for` card and _that_ card's `replacement_for` card, up the chain).

