---@class stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequest
---@field amount? number The dispute amount in the card's currency and in the [smallest currency unit](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies#zero-decimal). If not set, defaults to the full transaction amount.
---@field evidence? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidence Evidence provided for the dispute.
---@field expand? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestExpandList Specifies which fields in the response should be expanded.
---@field metadata? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestMetadataMap Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that you can attach to an object. This can be useful for storing additional information about the object in a structured format. Individual keys can be unset by posting an empty value to them. All keys can be unset by posting an empty value to `metadata`.
---@field transaction? string The ID of the issuing transaction to create a dispute for. For transaction on Treasury FinancialAccounts, use `treasury.received_debit`.
---@field treasury? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestTreasury Params for disputes related to Treasury FinancialAccounts
---@field idempotencyKey? string A unique key (up to 255 characters, for example a V4 UUID) that makes a retry of this request safe: Stripe returns the first result for a repeated key instead of performing the operation twice. See https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests.

---Evidence provided for the dispute.
---@class stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidence
---@field canceled? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceCanceled Evidence provided when `reason` is 'canceled'.
---@field duplicate? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceDuplicate Evidence provided when `reason` is 'duplicate'.
---@field fraudulent? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceFraudulent Evidence provided when `reason` is 'fraudulent'.
---@field merchandise_not_as_described? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceMerchandiseNotAsDescribed Evidence provided when `reason` is 'merchandise_not_as_described'.
---@field no_valid_authorization? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceNoValidAuthorization Evidence provided when `reason` is 'no_valid_authorization'.
---@field not_received? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceNotReceived Evidence provided when `reason` is 'not_received'.
---@field other? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceOther Evidence provided when `reason` is 'other'.
---@field reason? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceReason|string The reason for filing the dispute. The evidence should be submitted in the field of the same name.
---@field service_not_as_described? stripe.CreateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceServiceNotAsDescribed Evidence provided when `reason` is 'service_not_as_described'.

