---@field interval_description? string Description of the mandate interval. Only required if 'payment_schedule' parameter is 'interval' or 'combined'.
---@field payment_schedule? stripe.CreatePaymentIntentConfirmRequestPaymentMethodOptionsAcssDebitCase0MandateOptionsPaymentSchedule|string Payment schedule for the mandate.
