---@field capture_method? stripe.CreatePaymentIntentConfirmRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardPresentCase0CaptureMethod|string Controls when the funds are captured from the customer's account. If provided, this parameter overrides the behavior of the top-level [capture_method](/api/payment_intents/update#update_payment_intent-capture_method) for this payment method type when finalizing the payment with this payment method type. If `capture_method` is already set on the PaymentIntent, providing an empty value for this parameter unsets the stored value for this payment method type.
