---@alias stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsAcssDebitCase0MandateOptionsCustomMandateUrl string|stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsAcssDebitCase0MandateOptionsCustomMandateUrlCase1|string

