---@field amount number Amount to be charged for future payments, specified in the presentment currency.
---@field amount_type stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0MandateOptionsAmountType|string One of `fixed` or `maximum`. If `fixed`, the `amount` param refers to the exact amount to be charged in future payments. If `maximum`, the amount charged can be up to the value passed for the `amount` param.
---@field description? string A description of the mandate or subscription that is meant to be displayed to the customer.
---@field end_date? number End date of the mandate or subscription. If not provided, the mandate will be active until canceled. If provided, end date should be after start date.
---@field interval stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0MandateOptionsInterval|string Specifies payment frequency. One of `day`, `week`, `month`, `year`, or `sporadic`.
---@field interval_count? number The number of intervals between payments. For example, `interval=month` and `interval_count=3` indicates one payment every three months. Maximum of one year interval allowed (1 year, 12 months, or 52 weeks). This parameter is optional when `interval=sporadic`.
---@field reference string Unique identifier for the mandate or subscription.
---@field start_date number Start date of the mandate or subscription. Start date should not be lesser than yesterday.
---@field supported_types? stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0MandateOptionsSupportedTypesList Specifies the type of mandates supported. Possible values are `india`.

