---If 3D Secure authentication was performed with a third-party provider,
---the authentication details to use for this payment.
---@class stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecure
---@field ares_trans_status? stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecureAresTransStatus|string The `transStatus` returned from the card Issuer’s ACS in the ARes.
---@field cryptogram string The cryptogram, also known as the "authentication value" (AAV, CAVV or AEVV). This value is 20 bytes, base64-encoded into a 28-character string. (Most 3D Secure providers will return the base64-encoded version, which is what you should specify here.)
---@field electronic_commerce_indicator? stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecureElectronicCommerceIndicator|string The Electronic Commerce Indicator (ECI) is returned by your 3D Secure provider and indicates what degree of authentication was performed.
---@field exemption_indicator? stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecureExemptionIndicator|string The exemption requested via 3DS and accepted by the issuer at authentication time.
---@field network_options? stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecureNetworkOptions Network specific 3DS fields. Network specific arguments require an explicit card brand choice. The parameter `payment_method_options.card.network`` must be populated accordingly
---@field requestor_challenge_indicator? string The challenge indicator (`threeDSRequestorChallengeInd`) which was requested in the AReq sent to the card Issuer's ACS. A string containing 2 digits from 01-99.
---@field transaction_id string For 3D Secure 1, the XID. For 3D Secure 2, the Directory Server Transaction ID (dsTransID).
---@field version stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecureVersion|string The version of 3D Secure that was performed.

---The `transStatus` returned from the card Issuer’s ACS in the ARes.
---@alias stripe.CreatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecureAresTransStatus "A"|"C"|"I"|"N"|"R"|"U"|"Y"

