---@class stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequest
---@field after_completion? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestAfterCompletion Behavior after the purchase is complete.
---@field allow_promotion_codes? boolean Enables user redeemable promotion codes.
---@field application_fee_amount? number The amount of the application fee (if any) that will be requested to be applied to the payment and transferred to the application owner's Stripe account. Can only be applied when there are no line items with recurring prices.
---@field application_fee_percent? number A non-negative decimal between 0 and 100, with at most two decimal places. This represents the percentage of the subscription invoice total that will be transferred to the application owner's Stripe account. There must be at least 1 line item with a recurring price to use this field.
---@field automatic_tax? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestAutomaticTax Configuration for automatic tax collection.
---@field billing_address_collection? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestBillingAddressCollection|string Configuration for collecting the customer's billing address. Defaults to `auto`.
---@field consent_collection? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestConsentCollection Configure fields to gather active consent from customers.
---@field currency? string Three-letter [ISO currency code](https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html), in lowercase. Must be a [supported currency](https://stripe.com/docs/currencies) and supported by each line item's price.
---@field custom_fields? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestCustomFieldsList Collect additional information from your customer using custom fields. Up to 3 fields are supported. You can't set this parameter if `ui_mode` is `elements`.
---@field custom_text? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestCustomText Display additional text for your customers using custom text. You can't set this parameter if `ui_mode` is `elements`.
---@field customer_creation? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestCustomerCreation|string Configures whether [checkout sessions](https://docs.stripe.com/api/checkout/sessions) created by this payment link create a [Customer](https://docs.stripe.com/api/customers).
---@field expand? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestExpandList Specifies which fields in the response should be expanded.
---@field inactive_message? string The custom message to be displayed to a customer when a payment link is no longer active.
---@field invoice_creation? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestInvoiceCreation Generate a post-purchase Invoice for one-time payments.
---@field line_items stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestLineItemsList The line items representing what is being sold. Each line item represents an item being sold. Up to 20 line items are supported.
---@field managed_payments? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestManagedPayments Settings for Managed Payments for this Payment Link and resulting [CheckoutSessions](/api/checkout/sessions/object), [PaymentIntents](/api/payment_intents/object), [Invoices](/api/invoices/object), and [Subscriptions](/api/subscriptions/object).
---@field metadata? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestMetadataMap Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that you can attach to an object. This can be useful for storing additional information about the object in a structured format. Individual keys can be unset by posting an empty value to them. All keys can be unset by posting an empty value to `metadata`. Metadata associated with this Payment Link will automatically be copied to [checkout sessions](https://docs.stripe.com/api/checkout/sessions) created by this payment link.
---@field name_collection? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestNameCollection Controls settings applied for collecting the customer's name.
---@field on_behalf_of? string The account on behalf of which to charge.
---@field optional_items? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestOptionalItemsList A list of optional items the customer can add to their order at checkout. Use this parameter to pass one-time or recurring [Prices](https://docs.stripe.com/api/prices). There is a maximum of 10 optional items allowed on a payment link, and the existing limits on the number of line items allowed on a payment link apply to the combined number of line items and optional items. There is a maximum of 20 combined line items and optional items.
---@field payment_intent_data? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestPaymentIntentData A subset of parameters to be passed to PaymentIntent creation for Checkout Sessions in `payment` mode.
---@field payment_method_collection? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestPaymentMethodCollection|string Specify whether Checkout should collect a payment method. When set to `if_required`, Checkout will not collect a payment method when the total due for the session is 0.This may occur if the Checkout Session includes a free trial or a discount. Can only be set in `subscription` mode. Defaults to `always`. If you'd like information on how to collect a payment method outside of Checkout, read the guide on [configuring subscriptions with a free trial](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/checkout/free-trials).
---@field payment_method_options? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestPaymentMethodOptions Payment-method-specific configuration.
---@field payment_method_types? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestPaymentMethodTypesList The list of payment method types that customers can use. If no value is passed, Stripe will dynamically show relevant payment methods from your [payment method settings](https://dashboard.stripe.com/settings/payment_methods) (20+ payment methods [supported](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/payment-methods/integration-options#payment-method-product-support)).
---@field phone_number_collection? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestPhoneNumberCollection Controls phone number collection settings during checkout. We recommend that you review your privacy policy and check with your legal contacts.
---@field restrictions? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestRestrictions Settings that restrict the usage of a payment link.
---@field shipping_address_collection? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestShippingAddressCollection Configuration for collecting the customer's shipping address.
---@field shipping_options? stripe.CreatePaymentLinkRequestShippingOptionsList The shipping rate options to apply to [checkout sessions](https://docs.stripe.com/api/checkout/sessions) created by this payment link.
