---@field payment_method_options? stripe.CreateSetupIntentConfirmRequestPaymentMethodOptions Payment method-specific configuration for this SetupIntent.
---@field return_url? string The URL to redirect your customer back to after they authenticate on the payment method's app or site. If you'd prefer to redirect to a mobile application, you can alternatively supply an application URI scheme. This parameter is only used for cards and other redirect-based payment methods.
---@field use_stripe_sdk? boolean Set to `true` when confirming server-side and using Stripe.js, iOS, or Android client-side SDKs to handle the next actions.
---@field idempotencyKey? string A unique key (up to 255 characters, for example a V4 UUID) that makes a retry of this request safe: Stripe returns the first result for a repeated key instead of performing the operation twice. See https://docs.stripe.com/api/idempotent_requests.

