---@field state? string [ISO 3166-2 subdivision code](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_3166-2), without country prefix. For example, "NY" for New York, United States.
---@field tax_type? stripe.CreateTaxRateRequestTaxType|string The high-level tax type, such as `vat` or `sales_tax`.
