---@field posted_at? number The Unix timestamp representing when the tax liability is assumed or reduced, which determines the liability posting period and handling in tax liability reports. The timestamp must fall within the `tax_date` and the current time, unless the `tax_date` is scheduled in advance. Defaults to the current time.
