---@field card_testing_risk? stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentCardTestingRisk Stripe's assessment of this authorization's likelihood of being card testing activity.
---@field fraud_risk? stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentFraudRisk Stripe’s assessment of this authorization’s likelihood to be fraudulent.
---@field merchant_dispute_risk? stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentMerchantDisputeRisk The dispute risk of the merchant (the seller on a purchase) on an authorization based on all Stripe Issuing activity.

---Stripe's assessment of this authorization's likelihood of being card testing activity.
---@class stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentCardTestingRisk
---@field invalid_account_number_decline_rate_past_hour? number The % of declines due to a card number not existing in the past hour, taking place at the same merchant. Higher rates correspond to a greater probability of card testing activity, meaning bad actors may be attempting different card number combinations to guess a correct one. Takes on values between 0 and 100.
---@field invalid_credentials_decline_rate_past_hour? number The % of declines due to incorrect verification data (like CVV or expiry) in the past hour, taking place at the same merchant. Higher rates correspond to a greater probability of bad actors attempting to utilize valid card credentials at merchants with verification requirements. Takes on values between 0 and 100.
---@field level stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentCardTestingRiskLevel|string The likelihood that this authorization is associated with card testing activity. This is assessed by evaluating decline activity over the last hour.

---The likelihood that this authorization is associated with card testing activity. This is assessed by evaluating decline activity over the last hour.
---@alias stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentCardTestingRiskLevel "elevated"|"highest"|"low"|"normal"|"not_assessed"|"unknown"

---Stripe’s assessment of this authorization’s likelihood to be fraudulent.
---@class stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentFraudRisk
---@field level stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentFraudRiskLevel|string Stripe’s assessment of the likelihood of fraud on an authorization.
---@field score? number Stripe’s numerical model score assessing the likelihood of fraudulent activity. A higher score means a higher likelihood of fraudulent activity, and anything above 25 is considered high risk.

---Stripe’s assessment of the likelihood of fraud on an authorization.
---@alias stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentFraudRiskLevel "elevated"|"highest"|"low"|"normal"|"not_assessed"|"unknown"

---The dispute risk of the merchant (the seller on a purchase) on an authorization based on all Stripe Issuing activity.
---@class stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentMerchantDisputeRisk
---@field dispute_rate? number The dispute rate observed across all Stripe Issuing authorizations for this merchant. For example, a value of 50 means 50% of authorizations from this merchant on Stripe Issuing have resulted in a dispute. Higher values mean a higher likelihood the authorization is disputed. Takes on values between 0 and 100.
---@field level stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentMerchantDisputeRiskLevel|string The likelihood that authorizations from this merchant will result in a dispute based on their history on Stripe Issuing.

---The likelihood that authorizations from this merchant will result in a dispute based on their history on Stripe Issuing.
---@alias stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestRiskAssessmentMerchantDisputeRiskLevel "elevated"|"highest"|"low"|"normal"|"not_assessed"|"unknown"

