---@field cvc_check? stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestVerificationDataCvcCheck|string Whether the cardholder provided a CVC and if it matched Stripe’s record.
---@field expiry_check? stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestVerificationDataExpiryCheck|string Whether the cardholder provided an expiry date and if it matched Stripe’s record.
---@field three_d_secure? stripe.CreateTestHelpersIssuingAuthorizationRequestVerificationDataThreeDSecure 3D Secure details.

