---@field screen_width? number The total width of the cardholder’s screen in pixels. Returned from the `screen.width` property.
---@field timezone_offset? number The time difference between UTC time and the local time of the cardholder’s browser, in minutes. Returned by `new Date().getTimezoneOffset()`
---@field user_agent string The browser user agent. You can retrieve this value on the client side using the `navigator.userAgent` property, or in the HTTP request to your server before you create the 3DS Authentication.

