---@field customer? string Create a token for the customer, which is owned by the application's account. You can only use this with an [OAuth access token](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/standard-accounts) or [Stripe-Account header](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/authentication). Learn more about [cloning saved payment methods](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/cloning-saved-payment-methods).
