---@field expand? stripe.CreateTokenRequestExpandList Specifies which fields in the response should be expanded.
---@field person? stripe.CreateTokenRequestPerson Information for the person this token represents.
---@field pii? stripe.CreateTokenRequestPii The PII this token represents.
