---@field address_state? string State / County / Province / Region.
---@field address_zip? string ZIP or postal code.
---@field currency? string Required in order to add the card to an account; in all other cases, this parameter is not used. When added to an account, the card (which must be a debit card) can be used as a transfer destination for funds in this currency.
---@field cvc? string Card security code. Highly recommended to always include this value.
---@field exp_month string Two-digit number representing the card's expiration month.
---@field exp_year string Two- or four-digit number representing the card's expiration year.
---@field name? string Cardholder's full name.
