---Related guide: [Customer balance](https://docs.stripe.com/billing/customer/balance)
---@class stripe.CustomerBalanceTransaction
---@field amount number The amount of the transaction. A negative value is a credit for the customer's balance, and a positive value is a debit to the customer's `balance`.
