---@field customer_account string|distilled.Null The ID of an Account representing a customer whose available cash balance changed as a result of this transaction.
---@field ending_balance number The total available cash balance for the specified currency after this transaction was applied. Represented in the [smallest currency unit](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies#zero-decimal).
---@field funded? stripe.CustomerBalanceResourceCashBalanceTransactionResourceFundedTransaction
