---A discount represents the actual application of a [coupon](https://docs.stripe.com/api#coupons) or [promotion code](https://docs.stripe.com/api#promotion_codes).
---It contains information about when the discount began, when it will end, and what it is applied to.
---
---Related guide: [Applying discounts to subscriptions](https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/discounts)
---@class stripe.Discount
---@field checkout_session string|distilled.Null The Checkout session that this coupon is applied to, if it is applied to a particular session in payment mode. Not present for subscription mode.
---@field customer stripe.DiscountCustomer|distilled.Null The ID of the customer associated with this discount.
---@field customer_account string|distilled.Null The ID of the account representing the customer associated with this discount.
---@field ["end"] number|distilled.Null If the coupon has a duration of `repeating`, the date that this discount will end. If the coupon has a duration of `once` or `forever`, this attribute will be null.
---@field id string The ID of the discount object. Discounts can't be fetched by ID. Use `expand[]=discounts` in API calls to expand discount IDs in an array.
---@field invoice string|distilled.Null The invoice that the discount's coupon was applied to, if it was applied directly to a particular invoice.
---@field invoice_item string|distilled.Null The invoice item `id` (or invoice line item `id` for invoice line items of type='subscription') that the discount's coupon was applied to, if it was applied directly to a particular invoice item or invoice line item.
---@field object stripe.DiscountObject String representing the object's type. Objects of the same type share the same value.
---@field promotion_code stripe.DiscountPromotionCode|distilled.Null The promotion code applied to create this discount.
---@field source stripe.DiscountSource
---@field start number Date that the coupon was applied.
---@field subscription string|distilled.Null The subscription that this coupon is applied to, if it is applied to a particular subscription.
---@field subscription_item string|distilled.Null The subscription item that this coupon is applied to, if it is applied to a particular subscription item.

---The ID of the customer associated with this discount.
---@alias stripe.DiscountCustomer string|stripe.Customer|stripe.DeletedCustomer

---String representing the object's type. Objects of the same type share the same value.
---@alias stripe.DiscountObject "discount"

---The promotion code applied to create this discount.
---@alias stripe.DiscountPromotionCode string|stripe.PromotionCode

