---@field created? stripe.GetSubscriptionsRequestCreated Only return subscriptions that were created during the given date interval.
---@field current_period_end? stripe.GetSubscriptionsRequestCurrentPeriodEnd Only return subscriptions whose minimum item current_period_end falls within the given date interval.
---@field current_period_start? stripe.GetSubscriptionsRequestCurrentPeriodStart Only return subscriptions whose maximum item current_period_start falls within the given date interval.
