---@field proration_details? stripe.ProrationDetails
---@field quantity number Quantity of units for the invoice item in integer format, with any decimal precision truncated. For the item's full-precision decimal quantity, use `quantity_decimal`. This field will be deprecated in favor of `quantity_decimal` in a future version. If the invoice item is a proration, the quantity of the subscription that the proration was computed for.
