---When an [issued card](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing) is used to make a purchase, an Issuing `Authorization`
---object is created. [Authorizations](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/purchases/authorizations) must be approved for the
---purchase to be completed successfully.
---
---Related guide: [Issued card authorizations](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/purchases/authorizations)
---@class stripe.IssuingAuthorization
---@field amount number The total amount that was authorized or rejected. This amount is in `currency` and in the [smallest currency unit](https://stripe.com/docs/currencies#zero-decimal). `amount` should be the same as `merchant_amount`, unless `currency` and `merchant_currency` are different.
---@field amount_details stripe.IssuingAuthorizationAmountDetails|distilled.Null Detailed breakdown of amount components. These amounts are denominated in `currency` and in the [smallest currency unit](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies#zero-decimal).
---@field approved boolean Whether the authorization has been approved.
---@field authorization_method stripe.IssuingAuthorizationAuthorizationMethod How the card details were provided.
---@field balance_transactions stripe.IssuingAuthorizationBalanceTransactionsList List of balance transactions associated with this authorization.
---@field card stripe.IssuingCard
---@field card_presence stripe.IssuingAuthorizationCardPresence|distilled.Null Whether the card was present at the point of sale for the authorization.
---@field cardholder stripe.IssuingAuthorizationCardholder|distilled.Null The cardholder to whom this authorization belongs.
---@field created number Time at which the object was created. Measured in seconds since the Unix epoch.
---@field currency string The currency of the cardholder. This currency can be different from the currency presented at authorization and the `merchant_currency` field on this authorization. Three-letter [ISO currency code](https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html), in lowercase. Must be a [supported currency](https://stripe.com/docs/currencies).
---@field fleet stripe.IssuingAuthorizationFleetData|distilled.Null Fleet-specific information for authorizations using Fleet cards.
---@field fraud_challenges? stripe.IssuingAuthorizationFraudChallengesList|distilled.Null Fraud challenges sent to the cardholder, if this authorization was declined for fraud risk reasons.
---@field fuel stripe.IssuingAuthorizationFuelData|distilled.Null Information about fuel that was purchased with this transaction. Typically this information is received from the merchant after the authorization has been approved and the fuel dispensed.
---@field id string Unique identifier for the object.
---@field livemode boolean If the object exists in live mode, the value is `true`. If the object exists in test mode, the value is `false`.
---@field merchant_amount number The total amount that was authorized or rejected. This amount is in the `merchant_currency` and in the [smallest currency unit](https://stripe.com/docs/currencies#zero-decimal). `merchant_amount` should be the same as `amount`, unless `merchant_currency` and `currency` are different.
---@field merchant_currency string The local currency that was presented to the cardholder for the authorization. This currency can be different from the cardholder currency and the `currency` field on this authorization. Three-letter [ISO currency code](https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html), in lowercase. Must be a [supported currency](https://stripe.com/docs/currencies).
---@field merchant_data stripe.IssuingAuthorizationMerchantData
---@field metadata stripe.IssuingAuthorizationMetadataMap Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that you can attach to an object. This can be useful for storing additional information about the object in a structured format.
---@field network_data stripe.IssuingAuthorizationNetworkData|distilled.Null Details about the authorization, such as identifiers, set by the card network.
---@field object stripe.IssuingAuthorizationObject String representing the object's type. Objects of the same type share the same value.
---@field pending_request stripe.IssuingAuthorizationPendingRequest|distilled.Null The pending authorization request. This field will only be non-null during an `issuing_authorization.request` webhook.
---@field request_history stripe.IssuingAuthorizationRequestHistoryList History of every time a `pending_request` authorization was approved/declined, either by you directly or by Stripe (e.g. based on your spending_controls). If the merchant changes the authorization by performing an incremental authorization, you can look at this field to see the previous requests for the authorization. This field can be helpful in determining why a given authorization was approved/declined.
---@field status stripe.IssuingAuthorizationStatus The current status of the authorization in its lifecycle.
---@field token? stripe.IssuingAuthorizationToken|distilled.Null [Token](https://docs.stripe.com/api/issuing/tokens/object) object used for this authorization. If a network token was not used for this authorization, this field will be null.
---@field transactions stripe.IssuingAuthorizationTransactionsList List of [transactions](https://docs.stripe.com/api/issuing/transactions) associated with this authorization.
---@field treasury? stripe.IssuingAuthorizationTreasury|distilled.Null [Treasury](https://docs.stripe.com/api/treasury) details related to this authorization if it was created on a [FinancialAccount](https://docs.stripe.com/api/treasury/financial_accounts).
---@field verification_data stripe.IssuingAuthorizationVerificationData
---@field verified_by_fraud_challenge boolean|distilled.Null Whether the authorization bypassed fraud risk checks because the cardholder has previously completed a fraud challenge on a similar high-risk authorization from the same merchant.
---@field wallet string|distilled.Null The digital wallet used for this transaction. One of `apple_pay`, `google_pay`, or `samsung_pay`. Will populate as `null` when no digital wallet was utilized.

---@class stripe.IssuingAuthorizationAmountDetails
---@field atm_fee number|distilled.Null The fee charged by the ATM for the cash withdrawal.
---@field cashback_amount number|distilled.Null The amount of cash requested by the cardholder.

