---@class stripe.IssuingCard
---@field brand string The brand of the card.
---@field cancellation_reason stripe.IssuingCardCancellationReason|distilled.Null The reason why the card was canceled.
---@field cardholder stripe.IssuingCardholder
---@field created number Time at which the object was created. Measured in seconds since the Unix epoch.
---@field currency string Three-letter [ISO currency code](https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html), in lowercase. Supported currencies are `usd` in the US, `eur` in the EU, and `gbp` in the UK.
---@field cvc? string The card's CVC. For security reasons, this is only available for virtual cards, and will be omitted unless you explicitly request it with [the `expand` parameter](https://docs.stripe.com/api/expanding_objects). Additionally, it's only available via the ["Retrieve a card" endpoint](https://docs.stripe.com/api/issuing/cards/retrieve), not via "List all cards" or any other endpoint.
---@field exp_month number The expiration month of the card.
---@field exp_year number The expiration year of the card.
---@field financial_account? string|distilled.Null The financial account this card is attached to.
---@field id string Unique identifier for the object.
---@field last4 string The last 4 digits of the card number.
---@field latest_fraud_warning stripe.IssuingCardFraudWarning|distilled.Null Stripe’s assessment of whether this card’s details have been compromised. If this property isn't null, cancel and reissue the card to prevent fraudulent activity risk.
---@field lifecycle_controls stripe.IssuingCardLifecycleControls|distilled.Null Rules that control the lifecycle of this card, such as automatic cancellation. Refer to our [documentation](/issuing/controls/lifecycle-controls) for more details.
---@field livemode boolean If the object exists in live mode, the value is `true`. If the object exists in test mode, the value is `false`.
---@field metadata stripe.IssuingCardMetadataMap Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that you can attach to an object. This can be useful for storing additional information about the object in a structured format.
---@field number? string The full unredacted card number. For security reasons, this is only available for virtual cards, and will be omitted unless you explicitly request it with [the `expand` parameter](https://docs.stripe.com/api/expanding_objects). Additionally, it's only available via the ["Retrieve a card" endpoint](https://docs.stripe.com/api/issuing/cards/retrieve), not via "List all cards" or any other endpoint.
