---@field replacement_for stripe.IssuingCardReplacementFor|distilled.Null The card this card replaces, if any.
---@field replacement_reason stripe.IssuingCardReplacementReason|distilled.Null The reason why the previous card needed to be replaced.
---@field second_line string|distilled.Null Text separate from cardholder name, printed on the card.
---@field shipping stripe.IssuingCardShipping|distilled.Null Where and how the card will be shipped.
