---@class stripe.IssuingCardAuthorizationControls
---@field allowed_card_presences stripe.IssuingCardAuthorizationControlsAllowedCardPresencesList|distilled.Null Array of card presence statuses from which authorizations will be allowed. Possible options are `present`, `not_present`. All other statuses will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_card_presences`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field allowed_categories stripe.IssuingCardAuthorizationControlsAllowedCategoriesList|distilled.Null Array of strings containing [categories](https://docs.stripe.com/api#issuing_authorization_object-merchant_data-category) of authorizations to allow. All other categories will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_categories`.
