---@class stripe.IssuingCardholderCardIssuing
---@field user_terms_acceptance stripe.IssuingCardholderUserTermsAcceptance|distilled.Null Information about cardholder acceptance of Celtic [Authorized User Terms](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/compliance-us#issuing-terms). Required for cards backed by a Celtic program.

---@class stripe.IssuingCardholderCompany
---@field tax_id_provided boolean Whether the company's business ID number was provided.

---@class stripe.IssuingCardholderIdDocument
---@field back stripe.IssuingCardholderIdDocumentBack|distilled.Null The back of a document returned by a [file upload](https://docs.stripe.com/api#create_file) with a `purpose` value of `identity_document`.
---@field front stripe.IssuingCardholderIdDocumentFront|distilled.Null The front of a document returned by a [file upload](https://docs.stripe.com/api#create_file) with a `purpose` value of `identity_document`.

---The back of a document returned by a [file upload](https://docs.stripe.com/api#create_file) with a `purpose` value of `identity_document`.
---@alias stripe.IssuingCardholderIdDocumentBack string|stripe.File

---The front of a document returned by a [file upload](https://docs.stripe.com/api#create_file) with a `purpose` value of `identity_document`.
---@alias stripe.IssuingCardholderIdDocumentFront string|stripe.File

---@class stripe.IssuingCardholderIndividual
---@field card_issuing? stripe.IssuingCardholderCardIssuing|distilled.Null Information related to the card_issuing program for this cardholder.
---@field dob stripe.IssuingCardholderIndividualDob|distilled.Null The date of birth of this cardholder.
---@field first_name string|distilled.Null The first name of this cardholder. Required before activating Cards. This field cannot contain any numbers, special characters (except periods, commas, hyphens, spaces and apostrophes) or non-latin letters.
---@field last_name string|distilled.Null The last name of this cardholder. Required before activating Cards. This field cannot contain any numbers, special characters (except periods, commas, hyphens, spaces and apostrophes) or non-latin letters.
---@field verification stripe.IssuingCardholderVerification|distilled.Null Government-issued ID document for this cardholder.

---@class stripe.IssuingCardholderIndividualDob
---@field day number|distilled.Null The day of birth, between 1 and 31.
---@field month number|distilled.Null The month of birth, between 1 and 12.
---@field year number|distilled.Null The four-digit year of birth.

---Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that you can attach to an object. This can be useful for storing additional information about the object in a structured format.
---@alias stripe.IssuingCardholderMetadataMap { [string]: string }

---String representing the object's type. Objects of the same type share the same value.
---@alias stripe.IssuingCardholderObject "issuing.cardholder"

---@alias stripe.IssuingCardholderPreferredLocalesItem "de"|"en"|"es"|"fr"|"it"

---The cardholder’s preferred locales (languages), ordered by preference. Locales can be `de`, `en`, `es`, `fr`, or `it`.
--- This changes the language of the [3D Secure flow](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/3d-secure) and one-time password messages sent to the cardholder.
---@alias stripe.IssuingCardholderPreferredLocalesList stripe.IssuingCardholderPreferredLocalesItem[]

