---@class stripe.IssuingCardholderSpendingLimit
---@field amount number Maximum amount allowed to spend per interval. This amount is in the card's currency and in the [smallest currency unit](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies#zero-decimal).
---@field categories stripe.IssuingCardholderSpendingLimitCategoriesList|distilled.Null Array of strings containing [categories](https://docs.stripe.com/api#issuing_authorization_object-merchant_data-category) this limit applies to. Omitting this field will apply the limit to all categories.
---@field interval stripe.IssuingCardholderSpendingLimitInterval Interval (or event) to which the amount applies.

