---@class stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenMastercard
---@field card_reference_id? string A unique reference ID from Mastercard to represent the card account number.
---@field token_reference_id string The network-unique identifier for the token.
---@field token_requestor_id string The ID of the entity requesting tokenization, specific to Mastercard.
---@field token_requestor_name? string The name of the entity requesting tokenization, if known. This is directly provided from Mastercard.

---@class stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenNetworkData
---@field device? stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenDevice
---@field mastercard? stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenMastercard
---@field type stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenNetworkDataType The network that the token is associated with. An additional hash is included with a name matching this value, containing tokenization data specific to the card network.
---@field visa? stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenVisa
---@field wallet_provider? stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenWalletProvider

---The network that the token is associated with. An additional hash is included with a name matching this value, containing tokenization data specific to the card network.
---@alias stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenNetworkDataType "mastercard"|"visa"

---@class stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenVisa
---@field card_reference_id string|distilled.Null A unique reference ID from Visa to represent the card account number.
---@field token_reference_id string The network-unique identifier for the token.
---@field token_requestor_id string The ID of the entity requesting tokenization, specific to Visa.
---@field token_risk_score? string Degree of risk associated with the token between `01` and `99`, with higher number indicating higher risk. A `00` value indicates the token was not scored by Visa.

---@class stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenWalletProvider
---@field account_id? string The wallet provider-given account ID of the digital wallet the token belongs to.
---@field account_trust_score? number An evaluation on the trustworthiness of the wallet account between 1 and 5. A higher score indicates more trustworthy.
---@field card_number_source? stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenWalletProviderCardNumberSource The method used for tokenizing a card.
---@field cardholder_address? stripe.IssuingNetworkTokenAddress
---@field cardholder_name? string The name of the cardholder tokenizing the card.
---@field device_trust_score? number An evaluation on the trustworthiness of the device. A higher score indicates more trustworthy.
