---Related guide: [Issued card transactions](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/purchases/transactions)
---@class stripe.IssuingTransaction
---@field amount number The transaction amount, which will be reflected in your balance. This amount is in your currency and in the [smallest currency unit](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies#zero-decimal).
---@field amount_details stripe.IssuingTransactionAmountDetails|distilled.Null Detailed breakdown of amount components. These amounts are denominated in `currency` and in the [smallest currency unit](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies#zero-decimal).
