---Invoice Line Items represent the individual lines within an [invoice](https://docs.stripe.com/api/invoices) and only exist within the context of an invoice.
---
---Each line item is backed by either an [invoice item](https://docs.stripe.com/api/invoiceitems) or a [subscription item](https://docs.stripe.com/api/subscription_items).
---@class stripe.LineItem
---@field amount number The amount, in cents (or local equivalent).
---@field currency string Three-letter [ISO currency code](https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html), in lowercase. Must be a [supported currency](https://stripe.com/docs/currencies).
---@field description string|distilled.Null An arbitrary string attached to the object. Often useful for displaying to users.
---@field discount_amounts stripe.LineItemDiscountAmountsList|distilled.Null The amount of discount calculated per discount for this line item.
---@field discountable boolean If true, discounts will apply to this line item. Always false for prorations.
---@field discounts stripe.LineItemDiscountsList The discounts applied to the invoice line item. Line item discounts are applied before invoice discounts. Use `expand[]=discounts` to expand each discount.
---@field id string Unique identifier for the object.
---@field invoice string|distilled.Null The ID of the invoice that contains this line item.
---@field livemode boolean If the object exists in live mode, the value is `true`. If the object exists in test mode, the value is `false`.
---@field metadata stripe.LineItemMetadataMap Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that you can attach to an object. This can be useful for storing additional information about the object in a structured format. Note that for line items with `type=subscription`, `metadata` reflects the current metadata from the subscription associated with the line item, unless the invoice line was directly updated with different metadata after creation.
---@field object stripe.LineItemObject String representing the object's type. Objects of the same type share the same value.
---@field parent stripe.BillingBillResourceInvoicingLinesParentsInvoiceLineItemParent|distilled.Null The parent that generated this line item.
---@field period stripe.InvoiceLineItemPeriod
---@field pretax_credit_amounts stripe.LineItemPretaxCreditAmountsList|distilled.Null Contains pretax credit amounts (ex: discount, credit grants, etc) that apply to this line item.
---@field pricing stripe.BillingBillResourceInvoicingPricingPricing|distilled.Null The pricing information of the line item.
---@field quantity number|distilled.Null Quantity of units for the invoice line item in integer format, with any decimal precision truncated. For the line item's full-precision decimal quantity, use `quantity_decimal`. This field will be deprecated in favor of `quantity_decimal` in a future version. If the line item is a proration or subscription, the quantity of the subscription that the proration was computed for.
---@field quantity_decimal string|distilled.Null Non-negative decimal with at most 12 decimal places. The quantity of units for the line item.
---@field subscription stripe.LineItemSubscription|distilled.Null
---@field subtotal number The subtotal of the line item, in cents (or local equivalent), before any discounts or taxes.
---@field taxes stripe.LineItemTaxesList|distilled.Null The tax information of the line item.

