---@class stripe.PaymentMethodDetailsCardPresent
---@field amount_authorized number|distilled.Null The authorized amount
---@field brand string|distilled.Null Card brand. Can be `amex`, `cartes_bancaires`, `diners`, `discover`, `eftpos_au`, `jcb`, `link`, `mastercard`, `unionpay`, `visa` or `unknown`.
