---@field exp_month number Two-digit number representing the card's expiration month.
---@field exp_year number Four-digit number representing the card's expiration year.
---@field fingerprint string|distilled.Null Uniquely identifies this particular card number. You can use this attribute to check whether two customers who’ve signed up with you are using the same card number, for example. For payment methods that tokenize card information (Apple Pay, Google Pay), the tokenized number might be provided instead of the underlying card number. *As of May 1, 2021, card fingerprint in India for Connect changed to allow two fingerprints for the same card---one for India and one for the rest of the world.*
