---@field amount_guaranteed stripe.PaymentsPrimitivesPaymentRecordsResourceAmount
---@field amount_refunded stripe.PaymentsPrimitivesPaymentRecordsResourceAmount
---@field amount_requested stripe.PaymentsPrimitivesPaymentRecordsResourceAmount
