---@field metadata stripe.PaymentRecordMetadataMap Set of [key-value pairs](https://docs.stripe.com/api/metadata) that you can attach to an object. This can be useful for storing additional information about the object in a structured format.
---@field object stripe.PaymentRecordObject String representing the object's type. Objects of the same type share the same value.
