---@field shippable boolean|distilled.Null Whether this product is shipped (i.e., physical goods).
---@field statement_descriptor? string|distilled.Null Extra information about a product which will appear on your customer's credit card statement. In the case that multiple products are billed at once, the first statement descriptor will be used. Only used for subscription payments.
---@field tax_code? stripe.ProductTaxCode|distilled.Null A [tax code](https://docs.stripe.com/tax/tax-categories) ID.
---@field tax_details stripe.TaxProductTaxDetailsResourceTaxDetails|distilled.Null Tax details for this product, including the [tax code](/tax/tax-codes) and an optional performance location.
---@field type stripe.ProductType The type of the product. The product is either of type `good`, which is eligible for use with Orders and SKUs, or `service`, which is eligible for use with Subscriptions and Plans.
---@field unit_label? string|distilled.Null A label that represents units of this product. When set, this will be included in customers' receipts, invoices, Checkout, and the customer portal.
