---@field meter string|distilled.Null The meter tracking the usage of a metered price
---@field trial_period_days number|distilled.Null Default number of trial days when subscribing a customer to this price using [`trial_from_plan=true`](https://docs.stripe.com/api#create_subscription-trial_from_plan).
---@field usage_type stripe.RecurringUsageType Configures how the quantity per period should be determined. Can be either `metered` or `licensed`. `licensed` automatically bills the `quantity` set when adding it to a subscription. `metered` aggregates the total usage based on usage records. Defaults to `licensed`.

---The frequency at which a subscription is billed. One of `day`, `week`, `month` or `year`.
---@alias stripe.RecurringInterval "day"|"month"|"week"|"year"

---Configures how the quantity per period should be determined. Can be either `metered` or `licensed`. `licensed` automatically bills the `quantity` set when adding it to a subscription. `metered` aggregates the total usage based on usage records. Defaults to `licensed`.
