---@field product string|distilled.Null The ID of an existing [Product](https://docs.stripe.com/api/products/object).
---@field quantity number The number of units of the item being purchased. For reversals, this is the quantity reversed.
---@field reference string A custom identifier for this line item.
---@field tax_behavior stripe.TaxCalculationLineItemTaxBehavior Specifies whether the `amount` includes taxes. If `tax_behavior=inclusive`, then the amount includes taxes.
---@field tax_breakdown? stripe.TaxCalculationLineItemTaxBreakdownList|distilled.Null Detailed account of taxes relevant to this line item.
