---This hash is used to attest that the directors information provided to Stripe is both current and correct.
---@class stripe.UpdateAccountRequestCompanyDirectorshipDeclaration
---@field date? number The Unix timestamp marking when the directorship declaration attestation was made.
---@field ip? string The IP address from which the directorship declaration attestation was made.
---@field user_agent? string The user agent of the browser from which the directorship declaration attestation was made.

---This hash is used to attest that the beneficial owner information provided to Stripe is both current and correct.
---@class stripe.UpdateAccountRequestCompanyOwnershipDeclaration
---@field date? number The Unix timestamp marking when the beneficial owner attestation was made.
---@field ip? string The IP address from which the beneficial owner attestation was made.
---@field user_agent? string The user agent of the browser from which the beneficial owner attestation was made.

---This value is used to determine if a business is exempt from providing ultimate beneficial owners. See [this support article](https://support.stripe.com/questions/exemption-from-providing-ownership-details) and [changelog](https://docs.stripe.com/changelog/acacia/2025-01-27/ownership-exemption-reason-accounts-api) for more details.
---@alias stripe.UpdateAccountRequestCompanyOwnershipExemptionReason ""|"qualified_entity_exceeds_ownership_threshold"|"qualifies_as_financial_institution"

---A location where the business has a meaningful physical operating presence.
