---@field delay_days? stripe.UpdateAccountRequestSettingsPayoutsScheduleDelayDays The number of days charge funds are held before being paid out. May also be set to `minimum`, representing the lowest available value for the account country. Default is `minimum`. The `delay_days` parameter remains at the last configured value if `interval` is `manual`. [Learn more about controlling payout delay days](/connect/manage-payout-schedule).
