---@field default_payment_method? string The ID of a `PaymentMethod` attached to this Account's `customer` configuration, used as the default payment method for invoices and subscriptions.
---@field invoice? stripe.UpdateCoreAccountRequestConfigurationCustomerBillingInvoice Default invoice settings for the customer account.

---Default invoice settings for the customer account.
