---@field period? stripe.UpdateInvoiceLineRequestPeriod The period associated with this invoice item. When set to different values, the period will be rendered on the invoice. If you have [Stripe Revenue Recognition](https://docs.stripe.com/revenue-recognition) enabled, the period will be used to recognize and defer revenue. See the [Revenue Recognition documentation](https://docs.stripe.com/revenue-recognition/methodology/subscriptions-and-invoicing) for details.
---@field price_data? stripe.UpdateInvoiceLineRequestPriceData Data used to generate a new [Price](https://docs.stripe.com/api/prices) object inline.
---@field pricing? stripe.UpdateInvoiceLineRequestPricing The pricing information for the invoice item.
