---@field user_terms_acceptance? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestIndividualCardIssuingUserTermsAcceptance Information about cardholder acceptance of Celtic [Authorized User Terms](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/compliance-us#issuing-terms). Required for cards backed by a Celtic program.

---Information about cardholder acceptance of Celtic [Authorized User Terms](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/compliance-us#issuing-terms). Required for cards backed by a Celtic program.
