--- This changes the language of the [3D Secure flow](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/3d-secure) and one-time password messages sent to the cardholder.
---@alias stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestPreferredLocalesList (stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestPreferredLocalesItem|string)[]

---Rules that control spending across this cardholder's cards. Refer to our [documentation](https://docs.stripe.com/issuing/controls/spending-controls) for more details.
---@class stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControls
---@field allowed_card_presences? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCardPresencesList Array of card presence statuses from which authorizations will be allowed. Possible options are `present`, `not_present`. All other statuses will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_card_presences`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field allowed_categories? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCategoriesList Array of strings containing [categories](https://docs.stripe.com/api#issuing_authorization_object-merchant_data-category) of authorizations to allow. All other categories will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_categories`.
---@field allowed_merchant_countries? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedMerchantCountriesList Array of strings containing representing countries from which authorizations will be allowed. Authorizations from merchants in all other countries will be declined. Country codes should be ISO 3166 alpha-2 country codes (e.g. `US`). Cannot be set with `blocked_merchant_countries`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field blocked_card_presences? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsBlockedCardPresencesList Array of card presence statuses from which authorizations will be declined. Possible options are `present`, `not_present`. Cannot be set with `allowed_card_presences`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field blocked_categories? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsBlockedCategoriesList Array of strings containing [categories](https://docs.stripe.com/api#issuing_authorization_object-merchant_data-category) of authorizations to decline. All other categories will be allowed. Cannot be set with `allowed_categories`.
---@field blocked_merchant_countries? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsBlockedMerchantCountriesList Array of strings containing representing countries from which authorizations will be declined. Country codes should be ISO 3166 alpha-2 country codes (e.g. `US`). Cannot be set with `allowed_merchant_countries`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@field spending_limits? stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsSpendingLimitsList Limit spending with amount-based rules that apply across this cardholder's cards.
---@field spending_limits_currency? string Currency of amounts within `spending_limits`. Defaults to your merchant country's currency.

---@alias stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCardPresencesItem "not_present"|"present"

---Array of card presence statuses from which authorizations will be allowed. Possible options are `present`, `not_present`. All other statuses will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_card_presences`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@alias stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCardPresencesList (stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCardPresencesItem|string)[]

