---Array of strings containing [categories](https://docs.stripe.com/api#issuing_authorization_object-merchant_data-category) of authorizations to allow. All other categories will be blocked. Cannot be set with `blocked_categories`.
---@alias stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCategoriesList (stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedCategoriesItem|string)[]

---Array of strings containing representing countries from which authorizations will be allowed. Authorizations from merchants in all other countries will be declined. Country codes should be ISO 3166 alpha-2 country codes (e.g. `US`). Cannot be set with `blocked_merchant_countries`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@alias stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsAllowedMerchantCountriesList string[]

---@alias stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsBlockedCardPresencesItem "not_present"|"present"

---Array of card presence statuses from which authorizations will be declined. Possible options are `present`, `not_present`. Cannot be set with `allowed_card_presences`. Provide an empty value to unset this control.
---@alias stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsBlockedCardPresencesList (stripe.UpdateIssuingCardholderRequestSpendingControlsBlockedCardPresencesItem|string)[]

