---@field not_received? stripe.UpdateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceNotReceived Evidence provided when `reason` is 'not_received'.
---@field other? stripe.UpdateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceOther Evidence provided when `reason` is 'other'.
---@field reason? stripe.UpdateIssuingDisputeRequestEvidenceReason|string The reason for filing the dispute. The evidence should be submitted in the field of the same name.
