---@field cb_avalgo stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsCardCase0ThreeDSecureNetworkOptionsCartesBancairesCbAvalgo|string The cryptogram calculation algorithm used by the card Issuer's ACS to calculate the Authentication cryptogram. Also known as `cavvAlgorithm`. messageExtension: CB-AVALGO
---@field cb_exemption? string The exemption indicator returned from Cartes Bancaires in the ARes. message extension: CB-EXEMPTION; string (4 characters) This is a 3 byte bitmap (low significant byte first and most significant bit first) that has been Base64 encoded
---@field cb_score? number The risk score returned from Cartes Bancaires in the ARes. message extension: CB-SCORE; numeric value 0-99

