---On-demand details if setting up or charging an on-demand payment.
---@class stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0OnDemand
---@field average_amount? number Your average amount value. You can use a value across your customer base, or segment based on customer type, country, etc.
---@field maximum_amount? number The maximum value you may charge a customer per purchase. You can use a value across your customer base, or segment based on customer type, country, etc.
---@field minimum_amount? number The lowest or minimum value you may charge a customer per purchase. You can use a value across your customer base, or segment based on customer type, country, etc.
---@field purchase_interval? stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0OnDemandPurchaseInterval|string Interval at which the customer is making purchases
---@field purchase_interval_count? number The number of `purchase_interval` between charges

---Interval at which the customer is making purchases
---@alias stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0OnDemandPurchaseInterval "day"|"month"|"week"|"year"

---Preferred language of the Klarna authorization page that the customer is redirected to
---@alias stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0PreferredLocale "cs-CZ"|"da-DK"|"de-AT"|"de-CH"|"de-DE"|"el-GR"|"en-AT"|"en-AU"|"en-BE"|"en-CA"|"en-CH"|"en-CZ"|"en-DE"|"en-DK"|"en-ES"|"en-FI"|"en-FR"|"en-GB"|"en-GR"|"en-IE"|"en-IT"|"en-NL"|"en-NO"|"en-NZ"|"en-PL"|"en-PT"|"en-RO"|"en-SE"|"en-US"|"es-ES"|"es-US"|"fi-FI"|"fr-BE"|"fr-CA"|"fr-CH"|"fr-FR"|"it-CH"|"it-IT"|"nb-NO"|"nl-BE"|"nl-NL"|"pl-PL"|"pt-PT"|"ro-RO"|"sv-FI"|"sv-SE"

---Indicates that you intend to make future payments with this PaymentIntent's payment method.
---
---If you provide a Customer with the PaymentIntent, you can use this parameter to [attach the payment method](/payments/save-during-payment) to the Customer after the PaymentIntent is confirmed and the customer completes any required actions. If you don't provide a Customer, you can still [attach](/api/payment_methods/attach) the payment method to a Customer after the transaction completes.
---
---If the payment method is `card_present` and isn't a digital wallet, Stripe creates and attaches a [generated_card](/api/charges/object#charge_object-payment_method_details-card_present-generated_card) payment method representing the card to the Customer instead.
---
---When processing card payments, Stripe uses `setup_future_usage` to help you comply with regional legislation and network rules, such as [SCA](/strong-customer-authentication).
---
---If you've already set `setup_future_usage` and you're performing a request using a publishable key, you can only update the value from `on_session` to `off_session`.
---@alias stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SetupFutureUsage "none"|"off_session"|"on_session"

---Subscription details if setting up or charging a subscription.
---@alias stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0Subscriptions stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0List|stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase1|string

---@class stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0Item
---@field interval stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0ItemInterval|string Unit of time between subscription charges.
---@field interval_count? number The number of intervals (specified in the `interval` attribute) between subscription charges. For example, `interval=month` and `interval_count=3` charges every 3 months.
---@field name? string Name for subscription.
---@field next_billing? stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0ItemNextBilling Describes the upcoming charge for this subscription.
---@field reference string A non-customer-facing reference to correlate subscription charges in the Klarna app. Use a value that persists across subscription charges.

---Unit of time between subscription charges.
---@alias stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0ItemInterval "day"|"month"|"week"|"year"

---Describes the upcoming charge for this subscription.
---@class stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0ItemNextBilling
---@field amount number The amount of the next charge for the subscription.
---@field date string The date of the next charge for the subscription in YYYY-MM-DD format.

---@alias stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0List stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequestPaymentMethodOptionsKlarnaCase0SubscriptionsCase0Item[]

