---`POST /v1/setup_intents/{intent}/verify_microdeposits`
---@param input stripe.CreateSetupIntentVerifyMicrodepositRequest
---@return stripe.SetupIntent? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_setup_intent_verify_microdeposit(input) end

