---to an hour behind during outages. Search functionality is not available to merchants in India.</p>
---
---`GET /v1/subscriptions/search`
---@param input stripe.GetSubscriptionsSearchRequest
---@return stripe.GetSubscriptionsSearchResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
