---the <a href="/docs/api/payment_intents/confirm">confirm API</a> instead.</p>
---
---`POST /v1/payment_intents/{intent}`
---@param input stripe.UpdatePaymentIntentRequest
---@return stripe.PaymentIntent? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_payment_intent(input) end

